    "detailed_description": "Experience the dark and mysterious in Chapter 1 and discover the unheard of underneath the restaurant in Chapter 2.<br><br>You play as Andy a documentarian who is making a video on the Janko restaurant and all of its mystery's. <br>Andy arrives at the Janko restaurant with his friend Dell to gather footage of the place when something go's terribly wrong,<br>Now Andy and Dell will find out more about this mystery than they ever thought they would.<br><br>Janko is a mascot horror game inspired by survival horrors game's like Resident Evil and immersive sims like System Shock.<br><br>Explore a dark and forgotten restaurant while trying to get information on the CEO of Jank.co<br>find notes from the employees, discover secrets with a UV light, solve puzzles and hope you don't run into the things in the dark,<br>because if you do the only thing you can do is run.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897490/extras/20fcf99368ba8d327e312676000fe833.avif?t=1719130465\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span><br><br>Along your adventure you may find tools and unique items to help you on your mission such as a stun gun,<br>with the stun gun you will be able to temporarily disable any threats you may encounter<br>just make sure you have enough ammo for it or attempt sneaking by without anything noticing you<br><br><br>This game contains jumpscares proceed with caution",
